  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Mini Purple Heaven the heavenly crystal eagle nest floats in the vast sky. It is like a three-storey building with no doors or windows, formed from translucent heavenly crystal thicker than a human forearm and linked into one tight nest of the same color throughout. The outer nest alone contains five hundred kilograms of heavenly crystals. It is the thirteenth eagle nest from Iron Eagle blessed land, and Chu Du takes it for Fang Yuan during the Hei tribe battle. Fang Yuan opens it with Hei tribe refinement path killer moves plus attitude Gu’s aura. The nest shines in nine colors, the heavenly crystal pillars unravel, and an entrance forms on its surface.",
      "chapters": [
        1115
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_purple_heaven",
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "gu_attitude_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Together with light azure heavenly crystals from the storage pool in Mini Azure Heaven, the heavenly crystal eagle nest should last Fang Yuan five to six years of feeding for the upper extreme heavenly eagle. Heavenly crystals are not easy to buy in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1133
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feeding-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_azure_heaven",
        "res_heavenly_crystal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By a further aperture survey, the heavenly crystal eagle nest has been eaten by the upper extreme heavenly eagle, leaving only an upper extreme heavenly eagle egg and some heavenly crystal fragments.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
